Package: jarvis-cu
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: systemd, iproute2, at-spi2-core
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @DISTRO_NAME@ computer use helper for Jarvis
 Captures only the windows of the apps you allowed and moves the mouse and
 keyboard inside them while Jarvis uses an app for you. It refuses the
 shell, the lock screen, the installer, password prompts, terminals and
 password fields, and pauses when you touch the mouse or keyboard. Computer
 use is off until you turn it on in Settings.
